  "known_limits": [
    "Native bluetoothd LEHardwareModel and VSC dispatch lack a WCN3990 profile. The full system Bluetooth stack is not connected; BluetoothNativeStackReady remains false and NativeStackABI stays set.",
    "The adapter implements the three observed initialization scripts, not RunExternalScript/RunCommand. deepsleep requires the HCI host to close its port and performs full shutdown rather than deep retention.",
    "No production board profile/ROM/NVM is asserted. Default DT is disabled. Firmware preparation tests use automatically removed synthetic assets.",
    "The rootfs overlay/trustcache is staged only. No device, native XPC process, controller, scan, pairing, audio, CoreBluetooth or live socket callback test was run.",
    "Existing BAM/DMA handoff rejection and lack of deep suspend/external wake/controller coredump recovery remain."
  ],
  "analysis_notes": [
    "Independent native chipset factory was identified during this turn; BlueTool success is not reported as successful system-stack operation.",
    "Native Apple binaries remain byte-for-byte unchanged. Only offline launchd ProgramArguments and H4/POSIX environment selection are prepared.",
    "No new build scripts, model-specific naming or device operations. Temporary preparation fixtures are removed by their test contexts.",
    "Existing unrelated DTS warnings remain in bridge tests; final collection has zero errors or warnings."
  ]
}
